Description: macOS-style top status bar for Lingmo OS
 A full-width status bar pinned to the top edge of the screen. It shows the
 Lingmo menu and the application name of the active window on the left, the
 menu titles of the active window next to it, and the tray placeholders, clock
 and system menu on the right.
 .
 The menu titles come from the window's com.canonical.dbusmenu object and
 require an X11 session; the tray is still a placeholder.
